OL,3,GNEWSABristol then and now: Trams,
OL,4,Abarges and rugby
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the second of our interactive
OL,7,Fgalleries showing how Bristol has
OL,8,Fchanged over the years we head to the
OL,9,Fedge of what is now Castle Park and
OL,10,Fthen up to the other side of the centre
OL,11,Fto see how the roads looked with trams
OL,12,Fon them.
OL,14,FFinally we take a trip back to the home
OL,15,Fof Bristol Rugby. Not the Memorial
OL,16,FStadium, but nearby.
OL,18,FSwipe left and right to reveal how each
OL,19,Flocation has changed over the decades.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
