OL,3,GNEWSABristol then and now: Trams,
OL,4,Abarges and rugby
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere remains much debate about a
OL,7,Fpossible light rail or tram system
OL,8,Freturning to Bristol. Well as this
OL,9,Fpicture from June 1935 shows, it is
OL,10,Fpossible to have a tram network despite
OL,11,Fthe many hills of Bristol.
